{"id":"ba8612f4bcb9f360","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-gl-completeness-kripke.md","title":"GL Completeness via Kripke","display":"thm-gl-completeness-kripke — GL Completeness via Kripke","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-gl-completeness-kripke","aliases":["89-thm-gl-completeness-kripke"],"display":"thm-gl-completeness-kripke — GL Completeness via Kripke","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-gl-validity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-gl-completeness-kripke"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-gl-completeness-kripke</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gl-completeness-kripke — GL Completeness via Kripke"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"50df0572bbd651eb\" href=\"?note=50df0572bbd651eb\" title=\"89-df-gl-validity\">89-df-gl-validity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}completeness\\text{-}kripke}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GL}=\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}completeness\\text{-}kripke}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GL}=\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>GL相对于传递、逆良基框架完全</li>\n<li>Kripke语义给出GL的完全刻画</li>\n<li>记号与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"50df0572bbd651eb\" href=\"?note=50df0572bbd651eb\" title=\"89-df-gl-validity\">89-df-gl-validity</a> 的输出\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}\\)</span> 完全一致，不再引入第二套有效性缩写。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-validity","status":"resolved","id":"50df0572bbd651eb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-validity]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-validity","status":"resolved","id":"50df0572bbd651eb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"记号与 [[89-df-gl-validity]] 的输出\n$\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}$ 完全一致，不再引入第二套有效性缩写。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}completeness\\text{-}kripke}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GL}=\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}","display":false}],"bytes":790,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-495","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-completeness-kripke]]"}],"outgoing":["0006800fa1c85177","50df0572bbd651eb"]}